<title>UK: Brent reports mixed performance for Q1.</title>
<headline>Brent reports mixed performance for Q1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Brent International Plc said on Monday that its industrial and inks and coatings businesses made progress in the first three months of 1997.</p>
<p>However, the company told shareholders at its annual general meeting that quiet market conditions resulted in its imaging management business trading at levels similar to the second half of last year which were below levels achieved in early 1996.</p>
<p>It also said that overseas profits were being &quot;harshly affected&quot; by the strength of sterling.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
